status GREEN -- cold open 245 guards, 242 green, 0 red, 3 gated, tree_moved=no, run_verdict=ok, held still for. No tracked code moved this lap, so no witness changed state; the paper grades A 90 at Field with register 26 percent against a 30 percent ceiling, and the card stands at 40,948 of 40,960 bytes. The hot close over the staged tree is named in the commit body.
recommend keep-going -- run the sharper falsifier: rebuild unshared_citation's read phase resident and measure it in interleaved pairs. Above 6x the 8.68x generalizes and the 2.06x ceiling holds; 3 to 6x puts the fleet near 1.4 to 1.6x, under the 2x door; below 3x the plan retires on its own evidence. Three disjoint bands, one rebuild, one number.
